# NetForgeCN custom ad sources
# These are the lists that Loyalsoldier/v2ray-rules-dat does NOT include.
# dnsmasq-china-list/accelerated-domains.china.conf is already covered by
# upstream tags china-list / cn, so it is intentionally not duplicated here.
#
# Each URL is pinned to an immutable commit SHA and paired with the SHA-256 of
# the exact file. To refresh, resolve the upstream branch head, replace BOTH
# the commit in the URL and the digest, then review the resulting data change.
